le=\"font-family:Arial\">Manifestations:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Twilight Form,Fetter,Possess</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Numina:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Drain, Armored*,Regenerate,Stalwart</span></span><br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27385,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","user":"Cross-a-way","date":". 06-10-2023, 09:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-19T10:14:49-08:00","id":1525639,"title":"","content":"a couple of Spirits I made <hr /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Spirit of the Corn Feild</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A spirit that take the shape of an old woman with Hair being some sort of crop within the season, and her Clothes based off some sort of corn husks. She seeks to help those that work her feild</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Rank</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1[Spirit]</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Power</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4 </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Finesse</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resistance</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Willpower</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Essence</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Corpus </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">33, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Size</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">30, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Initiative</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Defense</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4, </span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Speed</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Influence</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> corn 2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ban</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">:Must reward the Duties of the ones who work her feild farmer; </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Bane</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Blighted corn</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#